    {
      "id": "cagrilintide-retatrutide",
      "name": "Cagrilintide + Retatrutide Stack",
      "aliases": [],
      "kind": "other",
      "identityStatus": "needs_confirmation",
      "categoryID": 2,
      "benefits": "Direct combination evidence is preclinical: cagrilintide plus retatrutide reduced body weight and food intake and improved circulating cholesterol, triglyceride, and insulin measures in diet-induced obese male rats. The combination exceeded the compared monotherapies in that experiment. No demonstrated human combination benefit was found; these animal findings do not validate a human stack or establish clinical synergy."
    }
